// ─── Tabs: the track stands at the rung, each tab inside its inset ──────────
//
// The `Size` rung is the bar's outside height, and the variant row says whether
// it is the TRACK's (`sizeRungIsTrack`). Where it is, the bar stands its track
// at the rung and each tab sits inside `tabBarPadding`, so a tab is the rung
// less that inset's top and bottom and the track — the tab plus the track's own
// padding — lands on the rung; where it is not, a tab is the rung and the bar
// states no vertical inset. The double lays no hugging frame out, so the track
// is read as what the canvas builds it from: the tab instances' height plus the
